    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis imposing, detached 4 bedroom residence is located in the much sought after, established residential development known as Laghtagoona in Corofin. Ideally positioned on a corner, south facing site (not overlooked) with ample parking facilities and private, secure and safe gardens, this property would make a fantastic family home. \n\nInternally, accommodation is deceivingly spacious comprising 125 sq.m. approx and includes a sitting room, open plan kitchen and dining area, utility room, wc, a ground floor bedroom and an additional 3 bedrooms (one of which is ensuite) and a bathroom on the first floor. Externally, gardens are mainly in lawn with a south facing rear garden providing all day sun to the generous paved patio area - ideal for al fresco dining. The property is bound by block walls and mature trees and hedging guaranteeing your privacy. \n\nThe property is ideally located within walking distance of all local amenities such as schools, shops, play ground, sports facilities, churches and the beautiful Inchiquin Lake is only a short stroll away but also has the benefit of being within easy coomute of both Lahinch beach and Ennis town.\nEarly viewings are advisable to appreciate what is on offer. BER C."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nA bright and inviting entrance hallway complete with tiled flooring, ample under stairs storage and a recessed cloakroom.\n\nSitting Room - \nLocated to the front of the property, this generous sized sitting room is complete with timber flooring, a large floor to ceiling window and a feature solid fuel stove. A set of double doors lead to the kitchen and dining area.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - \nOpen plan contemporary layout ideal for entertaining! The kitchen section is complete with fully fitted wall and base units, tiled splash back, tiled flooring and recessed spot lighting. The dining section also has tiled flooring and a set of French doors to a beautiful external patio area and rear garden which is not overlooked\n\nUtility Room - \nFully plumbed with additional storage units, tiled flooring and access to attic. Rear access.\n\nToilet - \nWith wc, whb and tiled flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - \nIdeally located on the ground floor, this bedroom is complete with timber flooring and a tv point. This would also make an ideal office or play room if desired.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nLocated to the front of the property, this fine sized double bedroom is complete with solid wood flooring & a spacious ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - \nPartially tiled with shower, wc and whb.\n\nLanding - \nBright and spacious with recessed hot press and a large velux sun light allowing ample natural light.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled and complete with bath, wc and whb.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nAlso located to the front of the property this bright and spacious bedroom is complete with timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nLocated to the rear of the property, this spacious double bedroom overlooks the private back gardens.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Imposing 4 bedroom detached residenc on corner, south facing site</li><li>Spacious accommodation and safe and secure site</li><li>Situated in a much sought after development</li><li>Close to all amenities and easy access to commute </li><li>OFCH and a solid fuel stove</li><li>Ample parking and low maintenance grounds</li><li>South facing rear garden providing all day sun to the dining and patio areas </li><li>Not overlooked and complete privacy to rear</li><li>Fantastic family home</ul>"
      },
